  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Marcelo Claure is a Bolivian-American entrepreneur who built his fortune through Brightstar, the global mobile-phone distributor he sold to SoftBank. A Bentley University economics and finance graduate, he later led Sprint and SoftBank Group International. He now directs investments through Claure Group and is a partner and co-chairman of Brightstar Capital Partners.",
